# TypeScript & Component Guidelines

## Component Structure

### Server Components (Default)

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT: Server Component
import type { HeroProps } from '@/shared/types/marketing.types'

export function Hero({ headline, subtitle, buttons }: HeroProps) {
  return (
    <section className="py-20 px-4">
      {/* Component content */}
    </section>
  )
}
```

### Client Components (When Needed)

Add `'use client'` ONLY when you need:
- useState, useEffect, or other hooks
- Event handlers (onClick, onChange)
- Browser APIs (window, document)

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT: Client Component
'use client'

import { useState } from 'react'

export function InteractiveComponent() {
  const [state, setState] = useState(false)
  return <div onClick={() => setState(!state)}>...</div>
}
```

## TypeScript Patterns

### Props with Interfaces

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT
interface ButtonProps {
  text: string
  href: string
  variant?: 'primary' | 'secondary' | 'outline'
  onClick?: () => void
}

export function Button({ text, href, variant = 'primary' }: ButtonProps) {
  // Implementation
}
```

### Type Imports

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT: Use type imports for types
import type { Metadata } from 'next'
import type { HeroProps } from '@/shared/types/marketing.types'

// ✅ CORRECT: Regular imports for components
import { HeroCentered } from '@/shared/components/marketing'
```

### NO 'any' Type

```typescript
// ❌ WRONG
const data: any = fetchData()

// ✅ CORRECT
interface ApiResponse {
  data: string[]
  status: number
}
const data: ApiResponse = fetchData()
```

## Tailwind CSS in Components

### Utility Classes

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT: Tailwind utilities
<div className="flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-screen py-20 px-4">

// ✅ CORRECT: Conditional classes
<button className={`px-8 py-4 rounded-lg ${
  variant === 'primary' 
    ? 'bg-blue-600 text-white hover:bg-blue-700' 
    : 'bg-gray-100 text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-200'
}`}>

// ✅ CORRECT: Responsive utilities
<div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
```

### Compose Utilities

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT: For complex components
const baseStyles = "px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold transition-all"
const variantStyles = {
  primary: "bg-blue-600 text-white hover:bg-blue-700",
  secondary: "bg-gray-100 text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-200"
}

<button className={`${baseStyles} ${variantStyles[variant]}`}>
```

### NEVER Use These

```typescript
// ❌ WRONG: Inline styles
<div style={{ display: 'flex', padding: '20px' }}>

// ❌ WRONG: CSS modules
import styles from './Component.module.css'

// ❌ WRONG: Separate CSS files
import './Component.css'
```

## Component Exports

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT: Named exports
export function Button() { }
export function HeroSimple() { }

// ❌ WRONG: Default exports
export default Button
```

## Component Props Pattern

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT: Destructure with defaults
export function Component({ 
  title, 
  subtitle, 
  theme = 'light',
  columns = 3 
}: ComponentProps) {
  // Implementation
}

// ✅ CORRECT: Optional props marked with ?
interface ComponentProps {
  title: string
  subtitle?: string
  theme?: 'light' | 'dark'
  columns?: 2 | 3 | 4
}
```

## Marketing Components

When working with components in [shared/components/marketing/](mdc:shared/components/marketing/):

1. **Check types first**: [shared/types/marketing.types.ts](mdc:shared/types/marketing.types.ts)
2. **Use proper imports**: Import from barrel exports (index.tsx)
3. **Pass all required props**: TypeScript will guide you
4. **Use theme variants**: light, dark, gradient, blue, purple

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT: Import from marketing barrel export
import { HeroCentered, FeaturesGrid, CTASimple } from '@/shared/components/marketing'

// Use with proper props
<HeroCentered
  headline="Your Headline"
  subtitle="Your subtitle"
  buttons={[{ text: 'CTA', href: '#' }]}
  theme="gradient"
/>
```

## Accessibility

Always include:

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT
<button aria-label="Close menu">
<img src="/image.jpg" alt="Descriptive text" />
<nav aria-label="Main navigation">
```

## File Organization

```
ComponentName/
├── index.tsx              # Main export
├── ComponentVariant1.tsx  # Variant implementations
├── ComponentVariant2.tsx
└── types.ts              # Component-specific types (if complex)
```

Reference [ARCHITECTURE.md](mdc:ARCHITECTURE.md) for complete structure details.
